    "text": "Evansville\nNew Publisher, New Vision: Longtime Evansville Magazine ‘News4U’ to Enter Its 35th Year Revitalized\nBy Ash,\n5 hours agoAfter graduating from college with a degree in Public Relations in 2005, I had no clue what I was doing with my life. I was bartending on weekends, living it up at the pool during the week, and doing my best to pretend the “real world” wasn’t knocking. But deep down, I knew it was time to put that degree to work and start figuring out my career path.",
